WEBVTT

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.220
And that's it.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:13.840
With this, it's finally...

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:14.820
It's finally...

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.780
...complete!

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.500
Cream bread please! Cream bread!
One melon and yakisoba bread!

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:32.630
Pushuu~.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:35.860
One egg salad sandwich.

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.600
Here, one egg salad sandwich.

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:41.310
I finally...

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:43.390
I finally bought it!

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:46.060
Good job.

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:50.530
I wasn't sure if you'd be able to buy one on your own before you graduated.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:53.550
This is on the house.

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:55.990
Thanks!

00:00:56.410 --> 00:01:01.010
Sophie bought herself bread without our help.

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:02.950
Chanko!

00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:36.930
The Man From Brazil.

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:40.930
This monja riceball is delicious!

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:43.080
If you say so, Dorthy.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:45.110
Aren't you going to eat it?

00:02:45.110 --> 00:02:50.270
I got this plum rice ball from the lady running the lunch stand, but...

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.690
Would you like it, Lala?

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:52.460
You sure?

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:54.360
Yeah! Awesome!

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:55.510
Here.

00:02:55.510 --> 00:02:59.320
I only have Red Flash before concerts.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.480
Then I'll help myself.

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:04.200
Thanks!

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:06.790
Sour!

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:11.310
That reminds me, President Minami already had herself a solo concert.

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:12.560
How unfair!

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:16.710
That's 'cause our spineless manager has holed himself up in a beauty parlour.

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:20.430
If Dressing Parfait reforms,

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:24.450
that curse will take away my handsomeness-usa!

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:27.600
There's no way I'll let that happen-usa!

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.890
Anti-aging-usa!

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:32.760
Kuma and Usagi both believe in this curse.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:33.860
How strange.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:36.760
That stupid Usagi has gone weak in the knees.

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:38.100
How pathetic.

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:40.200
Once convinced, there's no changing his mind.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:42.320
At this point, anything we say
goes in one ear and out the other.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:45.530
I wonder what kind of curse it is.

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:48.360
So you're afraid of curses.

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.330
What a chicken, Lala!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.310
I'm sorry I made fun of curses!

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:55.510
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:57.600
What was that?
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:59.960
Even a moment of weakness can prove fatal in the jungle.

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:05.800
It silently circles around behind its prey,
ready to strike at any moment.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:11.950
Awesome!

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:13.350
A gold medal!

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:14.860
What's with you, old man?!

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:16.570
Don't sneak up on us!

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:18.400
These are school grounds.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.570
Outsiders are prohibited from entering here.

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.810
My my my.

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:24.010
Calm yourselves.

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:26.180
I am no stranger.

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:30.290
I'm only here to hug my truly beloved Sophie.

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:32.750
To force a hug on a young lady...

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.960
Is inexcusable!

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.170
How vulgar!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.710
Regardless of how passionate a fan you are...

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:43.670
This is absurd, old man.

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:46.820
It's a principal's duty to protect their students!

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:48.560
This shall not go unpunished!

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:49.590
Um...

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:51.100
Please stop.

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:53.810
Huh?

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:56.590
That's...

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:58.520
...my father.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:04:59.590
Huh?!

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:03.220
What?!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:10.560
Please forgive our rudeness.
We didn't know you were her father.

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:12.160
We're sorry.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.920
Well, I had to find Sophie as soon as I could,

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:17.880
and rushed straight here from the airport.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:21.690
Of course my actions made it look strange.

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:26.090
He's completely different than you, Sophie.

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:29.140
I take after my mother.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:32.930
Unlike myself, my father's full of energy.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:35.060
After all, he's an adventurer.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:35.910
What?

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:37.020
Adventurer?

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.480
Here's my card.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.180
Ah, let's see here.

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:46.200
King of Adventure, Location: Earth?

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:49.660
Every day is exciting for an adventurer.

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:52.620
Taking killer pictures on the back of a killer whale,

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:55.330
owling in a giant owl sleeping bag,

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.290
tagging a tiger,

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:59.690
being pigged up on by a bunch of pigs...

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:01.630
Your gags are beyond the max!

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:05.300
Principal, I've brought you a souvenir.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:07.200
A-A snake?!

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:09.840
It's fake made out of rubber.

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:13.600
Since it has a zipper along the side of it, it's great for storing bamboo poles.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:15.560
Y-Yeah...

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:19.960
To be honest, we've been separated for quite some time,

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:22.700
but now we'll be able to live together once agian.

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:24.530
That's what I came to tell her.

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:26.530
Oh?

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:27.990
Isn't that great, Sophie?!

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:31.720
Since I lack the physical strength,

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:37.960
my father has been flying around the world in search of the legendary powerful plum.

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:40.570
Powerful plum?

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:42.240
That's right!

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:43.890
When it comes to its power,

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:46.760
it's said that one can run 30,000 meters with just one,

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:48.470
making it the ultimate plum!

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:49.930
Wow!

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:55.530
However, after ten long years,

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:59.380
I wasn't able to find that legendary powerful plum.

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:02.420
But I'll never give up!

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:04.650
If I can't find it, I'll just make it myself!

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:11.360
That's when I purchased a stockpile of legendary-grade plum seeds from a Brazilian merchant.

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:14.120
Her dad sure is decisive.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:17.200
I require precise calculations,

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.830
so that makes us complete opposites.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.680
Do not fear failure!

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:22.330
Challenge yourself!

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.750
Those are my mottos.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:28.800
That is why I give you this, Sensei...

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:30.480
Yes yes...

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:32.010
A t-transfer notification?!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.720
Eh?!

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:36.090
Hold on, Father!

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:39.180
I don't remember anything about transfer-

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:41.760
Are you surprised, Sophie?

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:46.150
Your father has created Prifornia,
a 10,000 hectare plum plantation.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:48.620
Prifornia?

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:49.890
What prefecture is that in?

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:50.860
It's another country.

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.260
What?!

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:55.070
That means Sophie's going to another country?!

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:58.540
Sophie and I will be leaving Japan next week.

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:04.800
And we'll arrive just in time to have the plum flowers greet you in full bloom, Sophie.

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:06.070
Sophie...

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:13.660
Sophie...

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:16.370
Are you really going to Prifornia?

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:18.390
I don't know.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:01.720
Making Drama Switch On!

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:13.480
Wondrous Angel à la mode!

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:17.000
I'll help myself.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:19.070
Ahh!

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:20.990
Delicious-nano!
Delicious!

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:25.130
Cyalume Change!

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:49.840
You're full-blown celebrities-nekon.

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:50.820
I'm thrilled-nano.

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:52.140
Of course we are.

00:09:52.140 --> 00:09:56.080
After all, our destiny is to become divine idols.

00:09:56.080 --> 00:10:02.030
Next up is the SoLaMi Smile's hit concert before they broke up.

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:06.290
The three of them get along perfectly!

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.000
Exactly what I'd expect of SoLaMi Smile-nano.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.730
However, according to my research,

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:15.970
Sophie's dad has returned home and asked her to live with him in Prifornia.

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:19.180
There's plenty of time.

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:23.320
Aloma Prophecy Grimoire, chapter 8, section 184:

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:26.680
"Recall the lightening which tears the sky."

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:38.880
Derodero derosaimu.

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:41.000
While it seems to trouble thee,

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:45.670
I'll say that SoLaMi Smile is not a proper fit for thee.

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:49.940
I have seen what thine future has in store.

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:51.480
I won't go into the unfortunate details,

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:55.120
but it would be to thy advantage to break away from SoLaMi Smile.

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:57.920
Break away from SoLaMi Smile?

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:03.330
If ye continue to team up with the overly powerful Lala and Mirelle,

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:07.140
thine presence shall continue to dwindle.

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:11.770
That is, so to say, a step toward being an invisible idol.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:12.980
Hey there!

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:15.110
This is the angel Mikan-nano.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:18.790
Spending time abroad with your father sounds wonderful-nano.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:24.830
If you go abroad, things like pizza and hamburgers will be big and worth eating-nano.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:26.620
I'd be completely jealous-nano!

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:31.300
Pitiful lamb, worry about it!

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:32.580
Yes, be troubled!

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:35.470
When people are struggling and
suffering with their problems,

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:39.590
that is the greatest feast for us.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:43.380
Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:45.800
Jello-jello Angel!

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:52.020
So this is where you've been, Sophie.

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:56.980
What is it?

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:06.880
My father's been searching for a
powerful plum for me for ten years,

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:08.580
and he's finally found some.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.510
Yeah.

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:12.910
I love my father.

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:21.380
Hey, Sophie, you know how we're doing our best to reform SoLaMi Smile, right?

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:22.900
Yeah.

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:28.600
Well, if living together with your father
that you love so much will make you happy,

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.640
I won't stop you.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:32.470
I'll support you all the way!

00:12:32.470 --> 00:12:33.560
Lala...

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:36.120
I feel the same way-pri.

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:38.490
Don't worry about us.

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:41.610
You should choose the path that you want-pri!

00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:44.200
That I...

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:46.570
That I...

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.970
I don't want to go to Prifornia!

00:12:54.970 --> 00:12:58.970
I want to continue doing PriPara with you two!

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:00.300
Sophie!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:01.510
Thanks!

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:03.470
That makes me really happy-pri!

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:12.720
Now you just need to tell
your father how you truly feel.

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:19.400
Yeah, but I don't want to see
my beloved father saddened.

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:20.970
You're family.

00:13:20.970 --> 00:13:23.320
You shouldn't keep anything from each other.

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.360
You have to properly tell him your feelings.

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:29.680
Your father did it because he wanted to-pri.

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:31.330
I'm sure he'll understand-pri.

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:36.850
Lala, Mirelle, thanks.

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:37.540
I'll...

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:42.000
...go tell my father my feelings.

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:47.740
You here, Honey?

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:50.450
Ah, welcome back-nekon.

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:52.320
The usual-kuma.

00:13:54.450 --> 00:13:55.060
Kuma?!

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.250
Why are you here?!

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.160
I should be saying the same thing-usa!

00:13:58.160 --> 00:13:59.190
Wha'd you say?!

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:03.150
Would the two of you care for bratcurse?

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.990
Bratcurse?

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:07.290
Bratwurst.

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:08.490
You scared us-kuma!

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:11.490
We're quite sensitive to the word "curse" as of late-kuma.

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:13.370
Though, I'll take one-kuma.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:14.780
Of course.

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:17.430
Just give me a moment-nekon.

00:14:17.430 --> 00:14:20.080
Because my accursed movements are a little slow.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.560
A curse?!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:28.120
It's cute how scared you get-nekon.

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:35.980
This is the Prifornia plum plantation that we'll be living at.

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:38.610
What do you think? It's huge, isn't it?

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:39.700
Father...

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:41.500
To tell you the truth, I...

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:44.090
There's nothing to worry about.

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:48.540
Your father will handle all of
the heavy lifting at the plantation.

00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:49.420
That's not it.

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:49.910
Huh?

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.550
I don't want to go to Prifornia!

00:14:56.550 --> 00:14:59.650
There are still things I want to do here!

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:04.050
Sophie, explain it to me slowly.

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:05.530
Huh?

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:06.590
What's this?

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:09.800
I'm in the middle of a complicated discussion...

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:11.030
What?!

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:12.850
You're kidding?!

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:18.190
Now then, I'll go comfort myself
at Neko Cafe again today-kuma.

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:18.970
Kuma-san.

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:19.560
Huh?

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:23.230
Enter me into a concert.

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:24.610
Kuma?

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:28.400
Sophie's doing a solo concert?

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:31.990
You said Sophie-sama's having a solo concert?!

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.370
Chanko!

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:36.160
It appears buying bread at the school cafe wasn't enough.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:39.370
Now she's trying to do a solo concert on her own.

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:43.160
We, her Royal Guard, will cheer Sophie-sama on...

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:45.500
...with the ultimate cheer we've been working on-chanko!

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.070
Chanko!

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.390
Sophie-sama...

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:53.430
...is life!

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:56.310
What?!

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:57.510
You're kidding?!

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:00.680
What happened, Father?!

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:03.280
It's already done for.

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:08.630
Although the several hundred seeds I planted have bloomed,

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:11.200
there wasn't a single plum to be found;

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.200
they were all cherries.

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:15.370
Father!

00:16:16.060 --> 00:16:17.830
Pull yourself together, Father.
Are you okay?

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:22.370
He just naturally goes at cosmic speed,

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:24.760
and never stops to think things through.

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:26.540
How unfortunate, Father.

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:29.800
He might not be able to get back on his feet quickly like he normally does.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.320
I...

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:41.020
Please scan the appropriate number
of My Tickets for your coord.

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:43.530
Coord Change Start!

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:48.860
A late blooming sakura coord decorated with cherry blossoms in full bloom.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:53.280
The dyed purple sakura leaves add to the cool taste that fits your image.

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.840
Flower Blossom Floral Coord!

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:06.090
I love you, Sophie-sama!

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:07.290
So cool!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:09.500
So beautiful!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:13.550
Have you been good, my little cagebirds?

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:15.260
Yes!

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:17.970
You're lying.

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:25.390
I have prepared the perfect song for you bad little girls.

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:30.360
"Solar Flare Sherbet Sakura Shower Version".

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:15.110
Sophie!

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:18.070
S-Sophie...

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:21.600
You've got this much energy now?!

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:25.040
Doing concerts with PriPara is her energy.

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:37.170
Making Drama Switch On!

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:39.300
Plums, peaches...

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:40.930
Cherry blossoms in full bloom!

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:50.120
Liberation Maiden Primavera!

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:55.270
Cyalume Change!

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:21.260
Cheer up, Father. Sakura and plums are both plums.

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:24.010
S-Sophie!

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:41.640
Purple, huh?

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:44.240
Of course Sophie-chan is the cool type.

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:50.430
You're really heading back already?

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:52.120
Even though I wasn't able to get dried plums,

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.290
the cherry trees will grow cherries.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:56.290
I need to rush back and harvest them.

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:59.260
That's what your concert taught me, Sophie.

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:00.720
Father...

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:05.380
Thank you for that splendid concert.

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:08.780
You've always lacked physical strength, Sophie.

00:20:08.780 --> 00:20:12.290
But with the energetic concert you put on with everyone's support,

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:15.310
you've made your old man proud enough he could ascend.

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:18.960
Sophie, do your best at PriPara,

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.280
and become a divine idol!

00:20:20.850 --> 00:20:23.240
Thank you, Father.

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:25.890
Lala-chan, Mirelle-kun,

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:28.240
please continue to look after my daughter.

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:29.080
Will do!

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:36.040
Bye!

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:39.540
Pushuu~.

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:40.710
Sophie!

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:41.560
Pushuu.

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:42.790
My oh my,

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:45.800
you really did a cosmic job this time!

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:48.800
Sohpie, are you okay?

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.440
The SoLaMi Smile break-up strategy was a complete failure-nekon.

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:57.830
Her flower filled concert was spectacular-nano!

00:20:57.830 --> 00:21:01.400
But Mikan likes meat buns more than flowers!

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:03.530
The prophecy was a failure.

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:07.620
Now that it's come to this, I shall consult the forbidden and most horrific prophecy!

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:15.480
The next prophecy; chapter 7, section 666:

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:18.000
"The one with crimson eyes strikes back."

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:20.530
If I turn the large number of mega-nees into zombies,

00:21:20.530 --> 00:21:22.260
SoLaMi Smile will...

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:25.300
No, I'll be able to take down <i>everyone</i>  in PriPara!

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:30.770
Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:34.350
Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:07.780
There's a problem-kuma!

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:10.720
Do you think you can do a concert
at the Dream Theatre-kuma?

00:23:11.070 --> 00:23:13.200
We don't even have a five person team yet!

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:16.760
It has been decided you will have your debut live at the theater's completion ceremony-kuma.

00:23:16.760 --> 00:23:20.250
However, the catch is,
you have to win the sports festival.

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:21.020
Capisce!

00:23:21.020 --> 00:23:24.370
We'll win and reform!

00:23:24.370 --> 00:23:26.420
Wait, if you do that, the curse...

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.330
I'm in trouble-kuma!

00:23:28.330 --> 00:23:29.160
Next time:

00:23:29.160 --> 00:23:31.770
First to the Dream Theatre-kuma!

00:23:31.770 --> 00:23:33.100
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.100 --> 00:23:34.550
Let's go PriPara!
